    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "For QuickTime movie files and MPEG-4 files, the asset retrieves this value from the `mehd` box of the `mvex` box, if present.",
      "ko": "You may set the value of a capture device’s [`activeFormat`](avcapturedevice/activeformat.md) in two ways:",
      "sourceHash": "8bc431669e2f85f53757641826ca9395947b0836c635d60bf6de2b656ec56b8d",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "If no total fragment duration hint is available, the value of this property is [`invalid`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreMedia/CMTime/invalid).",
      "ko": "If you set the value of this property to `nil`, the output vends samples in their device native format.",
      "sourceHash": "0817e1847266ea3b699f7d59422a760efa202ede5fca3cae6cd038943b230c92",
